cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these fixed panels, please cite the manuscript and this archive."
title: "A formula-portable, externally validated immediate-early-gene score for agonal state"
abstract: >-
  Fixed gene panels, frozen criteria and analysis code for a portable agonal-state score for
  post-mortem brain transcriptomics, validated against the Hardy death-circumstances scale
  across thirteen GTEx brain regions.
